WEBVTT

00:01:29.396 --> 00:01:31.676
speak in public and meet politicians.

00:01:32.316 --> 00:01:33.916
The more I learned,

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:36.236
the more I wanted things to change.

00:01:36.956 --> 00:01:40.716
Passion quickly turned into obsession,

00:01:40.756 --> 00:01:44.356
and when change didn't happen
as quickly as I expected,

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:46.196
at 14 years old,

00:01:46.236 --> 00:01:49.756
frustration settled deep in my soul.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:51.356
And soon after that,

00:01:51.396 --> 00:01:55.276
in my first years of high school,
I experienced my first burnout.

00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:59.196
But having said that,
I wouldn't have changed a thing,

00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:01.476
especially because in 2019,